Changelog: 16-10-2026 06:38:26

tools/check_upstream.py checks HelixSR too: the HelixSR Manager pins no release but gets the latest, so a stable
release newer than KNOWN_VERSION in the app's acquire.py (the newest one it was checked against) is reported, as are
a fallback named in the latest release's notes that is not the app's FALLBACK_VERSION, and a fallback release without
its zip. `check_upstream.py helixsr` checks it alone; the Upstream workflow runs it as a third job every Monday, so it
comes up with the Decky and shadPS4 checks. The tests cover it on a fake GitHub; the development chapter of the wiki
and MIGRATION.md describe it.

