Changelog: 15-10-2026 21:51:30

A weekly backlog review (owner's request): .github/workflows/backlog.yml runs on Mondays (07:00 UTC, and by hand) and
opens the "Backlog review" issue, or updates the open one with a comment, listing every item MIGRATION.md says is on
hold, by section, each linked to its line (tools/backlog.py). GitHub notifies the owner of the new issue or comment;
closing it after the review lets next week open a new one. With nothing on hold it does nothing. The workflow may only
write issues. CLAUDE.md says how to mark an item on hold. Tests: tools/tests/test_backlog.py.

